# DUSKLING A1, GLOWWORM GROTTO (room 22): the glowworm grotto: its way out leads back to the bubble shaft.
# Played from its way in with plain button presses (LEFT is the D-pad
# side, A the button side), found once by the route finder (cheat solve).
game duskling
wait 5
cheat room 22
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 10
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 6
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 27
wait 2
hold A 30
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 6
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 30
hold LEFT+A 7
wait 14
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 20
wait 2
expect room == 9

# a slam through the pink ledge onto the hidden spring bounces high enough for the warp within the warp.
cheat room 22
hold A 5
hold LEFT+A 7
wait 4
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 12
hold LEFT 5
hold LEFT+A 7
hold LEFT 3
hold LEFT+A 2
wait 3
hold A 35
wait 2
expect room == 23
